{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01282",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.58,
      "end_seconds": 7.12,
      "duration_seconds": 6.54,
      "text": "Hello doctor, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.38,
      "end_seconds": 12.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.52,
      "end_seconds": 18.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Well, I've been having a sore stiff knee."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.11,
      "end_seconds": 23.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.62,
      "end_seconds": 30.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "I'm on diclofenac, when needed for the joint pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.26,
      "end_seconds": 34.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Alright, how much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.32,
      "end_seconds": 48.69,
      "duration_seconds": 13.37,
      "text": "50 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box. I take carbamazepine, 200 milligrams, twice a day for the seizures. Ibuprofen gel. I take it three times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.25,
      "end_seconds": 54.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.86,
      "end_seconds": 58.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "It started yesterday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.52,
      "end_seconds": 62.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.8,
      "end_seconds": 71.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "I'd give it a seven, out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.5,
      "end_seconds": 74.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.88,
      "end_seconds": 87.92,
      "duration_seconds": 11.04,
      "text": "It usually comes with the knee giving way a little. The knee giving way a little? That's been for about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.93,
      "end_seconds": 93.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Have you had any locked knee, fever, redness or fall?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.34,
      "end_seconds": 99.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.11,
      "end_seconds": 103.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.2,
      "end_seconds": 106.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.45,
      "end_seconds": 112.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.37,
      "end_seconds": 118.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Arthritis in my knees, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.66,
      "end_seconds": 121.36,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.29,
      "end_seconds": 125.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "I've had epilepsy, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.22,
      "end_seconds": 143.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Okay, any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.89,
      "end_seconds": 146.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "No, never."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.97,
      "end_seconds": 152.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.26,
      "end_seconds": 157.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Yes, kiwi. I get an itchy mouth."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.29,
      "end_seconds": 162.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.94,
      "end_seconds": 167.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "My uncle has high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.34,
      "end_seconds": 170.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.91,
      "end_seconds": 175.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.15,
      "end_seconds": 177.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.55,
      "end_seconds": 182.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.08,
      "end_seconds": 185.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Have you retired yet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.63,
      "end_seconds": 191.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "I retired from the post office two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.06,
      "end_seconds": 194.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.92,
      "end_seconds": 200.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.3,
      "end_seconds": 204.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.44,
      "end_seconds": 209.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.97,
      "end_seconds": 214.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.19,
      "end_seconds": 230.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Okay, nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.61,
      "end_seconds": 259.3,
      "duration_seconds": 6.69,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 122 over 78, pulse 79, respiratory rate 15, temp 36.9 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.27,
      "end_seconds": 264.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 278.47,
      "end_seconds": 279.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.33,
      "end_seconds": 282.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.6,
      "end_seconds": 309.13,
      "duration_seconds": 7.53,
      "text": "The joint line is tender, there is a bit of crunching, and the knee bends to ninety degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.46,
      "end_seconds": 314.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.59,
      "end_seconds": 341.51,
      "duration_seconds": 10.92,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: It's hard to say. Knee osteoarthritis flare is one possibility and a meniscal tear another, and I'd rather not commit yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 342.78,
      "end_seconds": 345.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.31,
      "end_seconds": 366.59,
      "duration_seconds": 20.28,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's knee osteoarthritis flare, and we'll watch how it goes. Strengthen the thigh muscles and lose a little weight if you can. See me again in six weeks. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 368.45,
      "end_seconds": 371.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    }
  ]
}